-- EffectImplicitTargetA 1 (TARGET_UNIT_CASTER).  Its EffectBasePoints of 9
-- renders as 10%, which is the N-1 tooltip convention, hence 19 for 20%.
--
-- SPELL_EFFECT_HEAL_PCT is 136.  Note SPELL_EFFECT_HEAL_MAX_HEALTH (67) is a
-- different effect -- it heals to full, not by a percentage.
--
